  "item_short_desc": "<p>Showcase your American spirit with Rothco&rsquo;s US Flag Bearded Skull T-Shirt. This distinctive t-shirt features a patriotic bearded skull covered in the American flag on the front, making a bold statement. The right sleeve displays a distressed American flag oriented with the stars facing forward, an homage to service memebers. Crafted from a durable yet lightweight and breathable cotton blend, this t-shirt ensures comfort and longevity.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133103",
  "description": "<p>Showcase your American spirit with Rothco&rsquo;s US Flag Bearded Skull T-Shirt. This distinctive t-shirt features a patriotic bearded skull covered in the American flag on the front, making a bold statement. The right sleeve displays a distressed American flag oriented with the stars facing forward, an homage to service memebers. Crafted from a durable yet lightweight and breathable cotton blend, this t-shirt ensures comfort and longevity. Sizing information is printed on the inside back of the collar, providing a tag-free experience for itch-free wear. Perfect for casual outings, exercise, and other activities, Rothco&rsquo;s US Flag Bearded Skull T-Shirt offers a versatile and stylish way to express your pride. Whether you're at a barbecue, the gym, or a outdoor event, this t-shirt is the ideal choice for showcasing your American pride in style and comfort.</p>",
